@eellison had a use case for writing a replacement pass (pre-grad or joint) where a user would want to replace a sequence of operations with 1+ triton kernels (perhaps wrapped in an autograd.Function)
One cannot actually trace a triton kernel without wrapping it in a custom op or the triton kernel HOP. We should offer a probably-one-line decorator to wrap a triton kernel so that it can actually be traced
